  "quoteCount": 82,
  "friendLines": [
    {
      "title": "初次见面…",
      "desc": "我是愚人众执行官第十一席，「公子」达达利亚。而你——哈，也是能招致纷争之人，实在愉快。我们应该会很合得来吧？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_draw_appear",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cc/fmrlyvhwpxu082czmruxa4kgdoew7c5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·闲散",
      "desc": "在这干站着，也不会有对手找上门的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_explore_idle_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/69/lj1z9e7gb3c4vj9qpo72bb3ec6jrpr4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·比试",
      "desc": "嗯——附近就没有什么值得一战的强敌吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_explore_idle_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e9/qq5cfk0mkfc6986ku79v3pllilx0sr7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·愚人众",
      "desc": "不知道其他执行官在忙些什么呢？嗯，算了，无非又是那些莫名其妙的「宏大计划」吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_explore_idle_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9c/8tnk4hfauza2k040ak32nvag8iwotv3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "闲聊·雪国故土",
      "desc": "在我老家的雪原里这么闲站着的话，早该被冻僵了。哈哈哈。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_explore_idle_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/ff/ewjxfdd8qbp5ogdjxrwyagm6gou6e4s.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "雨过天晴…",
      "desc": "雨点打在水面上的声音，会把鱼儿吓跑。相比之下，雨后是钓鱼的好时机。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_weather_afterRain_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/75/1bvx5a52tjlmbkczt0i87hguwhcvaqp.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雪的时候·异国",
      "desc": "哈哈哈，不知老家那边，是否也在下雪？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_weather_snowy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/60/7p46gu0aq09hsuk5ozm2uo8m4qc7uar.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "下雪的时候·至冬国",
      "desc": "多好的雪！天地都和月光一样干净，在这样的舞台上泼洒的鲜血才格外炙烈。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_weather_snowy_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5c/325l2tda9p33f5rfhvqozeyvi83wt9m.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "起风的时候…",
      "desc": "啊！风中传来了纷争的气息。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_weather_breezy_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/39/doh3qidy8pvcw85zx90u9m6vlhwxk22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "刮大风了·异国",
      "desc": "真是畅快的风！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_weather_gale_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d1/mm0l1ht81uamff5ueczd08h7wea7w3d.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "刮大风了·至冬国",
      "desc": "感觉身体和头脑，都被穿过身体的风洗净了。真舒畅。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_weather_gale_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c4/ebs9ob4y7o46zozolj3q2zbd2n8ynkc.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "早上好…",
      "desc": "哟，伙伴！今天精神不错啊。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_greetingMorning",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/93/f27n65sahfhln1fjcb1cdgfufe8jrfw.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "中午好…",
      "desc": "你看起来状态还不错嘛，要不陪我切磋一下？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_greetingNoon",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/tszarwm7wyfx0odfu8ze7yghuaqkla0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚上好…",
      "desc": "哈——吃得真爽。活动活动，消化一下好了。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_greetingNight",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b7/dg53qno8d1ty4lzeu4g78ten9o8hhye.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "晚安…",
      "desc": "真是愉快的一天。明天再见，伙伴！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_greetingNight2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/hftgeigexzb72dkk013qhms7izv8k89.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于达达利亚自己…",
      "desc": "身为战士，要时刻把挑战之心系于刀尖之上。但无论胜败，都是无可替代的珍贵经历。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_idle",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e0/gq97onei7f18qia90q7ghjrlegqnz11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·同僚",
      "desc": "与你同行的事情，在别的执行官当中，已经传开了吧。哼，真想看看那帮人脸上的表情，哈哈哈。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_close",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d8/tjr5g9qe5o8o54zlzi5t9sgrw078wzf.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·兵器",
      "desc": "弓，其实是我最不擅长的武器。正因如此，我才要征服它。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_close1",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/7n7zn0xntw450q4il7pqt1057xghte5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·生存",
      "desc": "连神之眼也没有的你，竟有这样的力量，真是令人期待啊…在你抵达自己的极限之前，与我放下一切、决一死战之前，绝对不要倒下啊，伙伴！我绝不允许你倒下。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_close2",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/4gekc2lmgf6940dndk37x0e2k4twalq.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于我们·邀请",
      "desc": "伙伴，要不要加入愚人众？嗯，当我没说。以你现在的身份，和你在一起，连光明正大和其他执行官厮杀的理由也有了。这样的机会，实在无法放弃啊，哈。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_close3",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/98/6x6s5djvgtg030ydwxfx728rq99e75w.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「神之眼」…",
      "desc": "只要能让我变强，「神之眼」也好，「邪眼」也好，师承深渊的罪人也好，都无所谓…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_pendant",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/36/5xrmselybfafrb3ranty7rlo8umaw6m.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "有什么想要分享…",
      "desc": "在无尽的雪原里，生命随时都会被碎骨一般的纯白天地吞噬，连足迹也无法留下。为此，我们每日都在与看不见的敌人战斗。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_share",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/rf4lncd9lvnjmor4m5glgqddv49by4x.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "感兴趣的见闻…",
      "desc": "我曾经在世界的深渊与无名的巨大魔兽对视。总有一天，我会堂堂正正地，将那强大得令我骨髓冻结的怪物斩杀。届时，就拜托你当我的见证者了，伙伴！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_pref_gift",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/68/2r11qrwqiq64lhr5fu3inzt1ygtbfmt.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于丝柯克…",
      "desc": "有多少年没见到师父了呢。哼，下次和她比试的时候，希望至少能逼她用上双手来对付我。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_skirk_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/66/qqm5g9w26tj8uxa6hzybhxb5b79do8z.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于钟离·掂量",
      "desc": "那家伙城府很深，不知真正的实力又如何呢…哼，真令人期待。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_zhongli_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3a/mc3yu288jlfmf0s1tx5mooe1vhaxq1l.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于钟离·挑战",
      "desc": "钟离先生，最近可好啊？嗯…还不错？看来他倒是挺适应作为「凡人」的生活嘛。可恶…竟然把我骗得团团转，只有痛痛快快地交战一场才能平息这份不甘！\n你说…我打不过他？哈哈哈…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_zhongli_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/02/kcmj40bnlkmpkxof3grrtcjmaopm9dg.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「女皇」…",
      "desc": "女皇大人其实很温柔。但正是因为太温柔了，所以才不得不变得冷酷。正是因为梦想和平，才要向整个世界宣战。也正是因为她与世界为敌，我才有机会与你相识。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_barnabas_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ed/evq69q1cncb2cnhmeqn1yjq8o36zzoo.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于法尔伽…",
      "desc": "法尔伽吗？哼，光是想到，有朝一日能和西风骑士团的顶点、传说中的「北风骑士」交手，就兴奋得颤抖。活在这个世界上，真是美妙。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_varka_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7d/a0p04ca7saqsdeowwdt66obreb556wy.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「丑角」…",
      "desc": "他是愚人众最初的执行官，也是今日执行官们的领袖，只会在大场面出现。至于他的功绩…坦白说，我不关心。我效忠的对象是女皇大人。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_pierro_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/bvl1l3cs7rt9e8ic69edmctz47vdy3g.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「队长」…",
      "desc": "我曾见过他在战场上的模样，实在是过于强悍了。或许我的席位太靠后了吧，让他没有留意到我。但就算今天被他忽视，明天，我也会让他看到我的实力。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_capitano_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/6/6a/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_The_Captain.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「博士」…",
      "desc": "听说他把不同年龄段的自己切片做成了义体，负责不同的任务。没办法，我的同僚都是些不太正常的人。反过来想想，要是某一天，我遇见了自己的义体…哈，肯定得和对方决出真正能活下去的那一个。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_dottore_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/fd/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_The_Doctor.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「少女」…",
      "desc": "愚人众执行官的席位是按照实力划分的，我不明白那个女孩为什么是「第三席」。有机会的话，我是想和排在我之前的执行官都比试一遍啦，但总有种不太想和她交手的感觉…不管怎么说，你也小心一点。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_columbina_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c8/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_Damselette.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「仆人」…",
      "desc": "我不讨厌有自己打算的人。毕竟我加入愚人众，也是为了获得更多争斗的机会。但这个人，我不喜欢。如果背叛能够获得收益，她会毫不留情地向女皇大人挥剑。她的眼里只有疯狂。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_arlecchino_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/cc/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_The_Knave.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「公鸡」…",
      "desc": "我不懂什么人情世故。但我知道，他是真心想要帮助我的。他看我的眼神，就像看待家人一样。哦，说到这个，冬妮娅和托克给我回信的时候，时常提到他送去家里的馅饼和礼物。在我暂别冬都期间，他确实按照约定，照顾好了我的家人们。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_pulcinella_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/0/0d/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_The_Rooster.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「木偶」…",
      "desc": "好像是个埋头研究的人？我想想，那些机械是不是都跟她有关啊。总之，仅有几次的见面中，她一副想杀了我的眼神。可我完全不记得做过什么惹她生气的事。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_sandrone_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/0/02/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_Marionette.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「富人」…",
      "desc": "哦，那个满脑子「宏大计划」的野心家。他的那些理论，我半句都听不进去啊。总之，只要后备资金管够就好啦。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_pantalone_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/21/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_Regrator.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「女士」…",
      "desc": "我和她合不来，你是知道的。如今也不必评价她本人了吧。对于执行官而言，死期并不掌握在自己手上…不过，放心，我是无论如何，都会拼尽全力活下去的。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_signora_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/b/b1/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_The_Fair_Lady.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "关于「散兵」…",
      "desc": "他带着「神之心」与我们失去了联络，后面才有了追回那颗心的行动。我倒是不介意去四处走走，说不定还能在哪儿和你偶遇？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_teammate_scaramouche_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e7/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_About_The_Balladeer.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解达达利亚·其一",
      "desc": "记住了，伙伴，我是终有一天要征服世界的人！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_friendship_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/bvl1l3cs7rt9e8ic69edmctz47vdy3g.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解达达利亚·其二",
      "desc": "无论决斗的对手是神，还是深渊的魔兽，只要有形，就有得胜的可能。但执行官当中，有的人热衷于权术、阴谋那些…「看不见的手段」。我跟那些无聊的家伙合不来。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_friendship_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7f/g3w8ssbdnpsjpr2fhu35p4ut39j8n17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解达达利亚·其三",
      "desc": "这里的天空和故乡的天空是连成一片的。抬头看见雪一样的月光，就能想到，老家的人们也能看见同一个月亮。不知道弟弟妹妹…哈，他们有没有变成出色的战士呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_friendship_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/8o3rtqm9f8yvt6zomyspngb9itbny68.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解达达利亚·其四",
      "desc": "伙伴，不要忘记：厮杀的时候，绝不能用什么「燃烧起来了」之类的蠢话来驱策自己。毕竟，燃尽之后，除了灰烬，什么也不会剩下。无论如何，都要活下去。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_friendship_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/c421t89a4ym063v0dyr3tkxljl6yjgq.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "想要了解达达利亚·其五",
      "desc": "时间过得真快。总有一天，我要让你亲眼看见我征服世界的样子、我把神的王座踩在脚下的样子。哈哈，在那之前，你可绝对不要倒下啊，伙伴！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_friendship_05",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c6/ha3e78xn5ud00d85653tbudpeswo0qy.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "达达利亚的爱好…",
      "desc": "冰钓和决斗的道理是相通的，关键是耐心与决断。这么说来，同样的道理好像也能应用在人生中的所有事情上？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_pref_hobby",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/krnh3mqa85v6z6np11r895pqx71csy5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "达达利亚的烦恼…",
      "desc": "嗯？烦恼的事情…哼，与你同行，总是有值得挑战的强敌，根本没空思考这种琐碎无趣的小事。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_dialog_annoyed",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/14/2on49sgmk9abyxgy84dh5ygwau8j69y.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "喜欢的食物…",
      "desc": "这个世界上，充满了美妙的料理和酣畅淋漓的战斗。活着真是美妙！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_pref_foodLike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/9m9g0jq7wixwmkyhfax09bzuhgkz5sr.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "讨厌的食物…",
      "desc": "食物和武器是一样的。真正的战士不会挑剔兵器，也不会挑剔食物。你也不要挑食啊。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_pref_foodDislike",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6f/9bj5prz2f9rmm5hbfcsd9rp2clptob5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其一",
      "desc": "只要吃到好吃的，心情就会十分舒畅。我该如何回报你呢？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_spice_pref_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/gqgno4ovck373wcllflwuw2ciingg9f.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其二",
      "desc": "你的厨艺似乎长进了不少。难道你也在不断变强吗？",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_spice_normal_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/5/54/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_Receiving_a_Gift_-_02.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "收到赠礼·其三",
      "desc": "真是出乎意料的口感，好…我就再试一次吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_spice_dislike_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2a/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_Receiving_a_Gift_-_03.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "生日…",
      "desc": "哟，伙伴，生日快乐！有什么想痛打一顿的人吗？有的话，就尽管说出来吧！",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_pref_birthday",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/49/VO_ZH_Tartaglia_Birthday.ogg"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·起",
      "desc": "喔！好像变强了一些。找谁试试好了…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_starUp_01",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/gqgno4ovck373wcllflwuw2ciingg9f.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·承",
      "desc": "「战士的力量就像一个圆。圆越大，能挑战的人就越多。」欸，这句话是谁说的来着…",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_starUp_02",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/nt12afxcpuaz936w3y5fbolg7q9l3wr.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·转",
      "desc": "真不错！伙伴，多亏了你，我离「征服世界」的目标又近了一步。就连女皇大人，也不曾料想过我这样的成长吧。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_starUp_03",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e2/fky47dohpkn4h2n5zpr2pz20i0nz611.mp3"
    },
    {
      "title": "突破的感受·合",
      "desc": "伙伴，你也要好好锻炼自己才行！不然的话，等我到达了世界的顶点，又有谁能与我殊死厮杀呢？哈哈哈。",
      "voicefile": "VO_friendship/VO_tartaglia/vo_tartaglia_starUp_04",
      "localAudio": null,
      "audioUrl": "https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ea/lnsivouummyoex1tiwfr7po91plj188.mp3"
    }
  ],
